      <p>Excise Tariff Amendment (Tobacco) Act 2014</p>
      <p>No. 9, 2014</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to excise tariffs, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedule(s)	2</p>
